{"title":"Career Roadmap: Brand Designer","role":"Brand Designer","summary":"Career Domain: Media, Communication, Arts & Design · Qualification Pathway: B.Des – Communication / Graphic Design · Target Career: Brand Designer","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Des (Bachelor of Design)","Course":"Communication / Graphic Design"},"about":[{"label":"About this roadmap","text":"This roadmap was drafted with AI assistance from OneGrasp's related roadmaps and is awaiting expert review. Check fees, dates, eligibility and exam patterns on the official websites before you rely on them."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Brand Designer creates the visual identity of a company or product - logo, colours, typography, packaging and the design system that keeps everything consistent."},{"type":"h","text":"What a Brand Designer does"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design logos, identity systems and brand guidelines"},{"text":"Apply the brand to packaging, digital and print"},{"text":"Present concepts to clients and refine them"},{"text":"Keep design consistent across teams"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Where they work:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Branding and design studios"},{"text":"Advertising agencies"},{"text":"In-house brand teams at companies and start-ups"},{"text":"Freelance practice"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Career stage","Typical role"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry-level"},{"text":"Junior Designer"}],[{"text":"Early career"},{"text":"Brand Designer"}],[{"text":"Mid-level"},{"text":"Senior Designer"}],[{"text":"Senior"},{"text":"Design Lead / Art Director"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Creative Director"}]]}]},{"heading":"Year-by-Year Learning Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1: Design basics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Drawing, colour, composition and typography"},{"text":"Learn Illustrator and Photoshop"},{"text":"Study famous brand identities"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2: Identity design"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design 3 complete identities for imaginary brands"},{"text":"Learn packaging and print production"},{"text":"Learn Figma"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3: Clients and experience"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Intern at a branding studio"},{"text":"Design for a real small business or NGO"},{"text":"Learn brand strategy basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4: Portfolio"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Final project: a full brand system with guidelines"},{"text":"Publish case studies on Behance"},{"text":"Apply to studios and in-house teams"}]}]},{"heading":"Essential Skills","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Type"],"rows":[[{"text":"Logo and identity design"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Typography"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Packaging"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Design systems"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Presenting ideas"},{"text":"Professional"}],[{"text":"Listening to clients"},{"text":"Professional"}],[{"text":"Taste and judgement"},{"text":"Professional"}]]}]},{"heading":"Tools and Technologies to Learn","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Adobe Illustrator"},{"text":"Photoshop"},{"text":"InDesign"},{"text":"Figma"}]}]},{"heading":"Internships and Practical Experience","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Branding studios"},{"text":"Ad agencies"},{"text":"Start-up design teams"}]}]},{"heading":"Certifications and Additional Training","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Adobe Certified Professional"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Before you enrol","text":"Check the current syllabus, fees and eligibility on the certifying body's official website."}]},{"heading":"Higher Education Options in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Options after your degree:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.Des Com